.TH scan 1 0.2.14 https://github.com/dbowm91/cargo-cleanme "General Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
scan \- Reconcile the machine read\-only
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBscan\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIROOT\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reconcile the machine read\-only.
.PP
With no ROOT this walks the platform. That is the only operation allowed to expire learned roots. An optional ROOT bounds the walk to that directory and bypasses configured ignore rules.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
[\fIROOT\fR]
Optional bounded root. Makes the scan Explicit and bypasses configured ignore/unignore filters
